proposed.description:
Engineer handover notes — the full summary shown in the calendar event. Use this exact format:
CUSTOMER: {{customer_name}} | ADDRESS: {{address_line1}}, {{address_city}}, {{address_postcode}} | PHONE: {{caller_phone_number}} | PROBLEM: {{problem_category}} | SYMPTOMS: {{symptom_brief}}{{error_code_block}}{{boiler_make_block}}

Where {{error_code_block}} = ' | ERROR CODE: {{error_code}}' (if exists), {{boiler_make_block}} = ' | BOILER: {{boiler_make}}' (if exists). Maps to booking description in Cal.com.
